<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TENNIS-SOUTH AFRICA CUT AUSTRALIA'S LEAD TO 2-1.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SOUTH AFRICA CUT AUSTRALIA'S LEAD TO 2-1.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results on the second day of the</p>
<p>Fed Cup world group two tie between South Africa and Australia</p>
<p>on Sunday:</p>
<p>(South African names first):</p>
<p>Amanda Coetzer beat Annabel Ellwood 1-6 6-1 6-0</p>
<p>Australia lead 2-1.</p>
</text>
